    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mi>b</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math><br /><br />Hence,&nbsp;the minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>.&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mi>b</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
